# Open hat at step 0, closed hat at step 2 on the same track: the open hat must be cut short (chip-style one noise
# channel per track); the metallic open hat at step 8 is cut by the metallic closed hat at step 10.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.8
track perc
param p1 128 0
param p2 128 0
note 0 Eb4 2 110
note 2 Db4 1 40
note 8 E4 2 110
note 10 D4 1 40
expect sound 0 2
expect sound 8 10
expect idle 20
